12	// What a fix needs to edit a manifest without re-serialising it (§3.80): the
13	// node to change, and where in the bytes it sits. yaml.v3 knows the first and
14	// only the line and column of the second; these turn one into the other, so
15	// the edit is a byte range and everything around it — comments, anchors,
16	// indentation, quoting elsewhere — stays exactly as the author wrote it.
